  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "Sy2EwL0x8gTK"
   },
   "source": [
    "## 導入庫"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "LjQ4e57vmWCP"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import jax\n",
    "import jax.numpy as jnp\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "from flax import jax_utils\n",
    "from flax.training.common_utils import shard\n",
    "from transformers import FlaxGemmaForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "DRqIBQOmA7Nc"
   },
   "source": [
    "## 如何存取Gemma：\n",
    "\n",
    "在首次使用Gemma之前，您需要透過[Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-2b)請求存取模型。這可確保您已接受該模型的使用條款。\n",
    "由於您將從 Hugging Face Hub 下載 Gemma 模型權重，因此您需要 Hugging Face token 來驗證您的接受。\n",
    "如果您還沒有 Hugging Face 帳戶，您可以在 [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/join) 註冊帳戶。擁有帳戶後，請依照下列步驟操作：\n",
    "1. 前往 [Hugging Face Gemma 型號卡](https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-2b) 並選擇請求存取權限。\n",
